# Drive the City II: prospective version-control ignore rules.
# No Git repository exists yet (see OPEN-029 in docs/planning/RISKS_AND_OPEN_QUESTIONS.md).
# These rules keep private machine data and generated artifacts out of version control once one exists.
# They intentionally do NOT ignore docs/, *.md, or future source folders.

# Machine-specific and private files (real copy of docs/engineering/LOCAL_ENVIRONMENT.example.md lives here).
.local/

# Generated artifacts: builds, large logs, captures, dumps (see docs/quality/evidence/README.md).
artifacts/

# Future .NET / IDE build output and per-user IDE state (adjust when the code layout is decided in PHASE-01).
bin/
obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Future UI tooling dependencies.
node_modules/

# Python caches from local documentation-validation scripts.
__pycache__/

# Operating-system and OneDrive/Office temporary files.
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
~$*

# Reminder (policy, not a pattern): never place CS2 saves, game DLLs, or extracted game assets in this project.
